<title>SPAIN: Spain's Alba 96 net profit 7.51 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain's Alba 96 net profit 7.51 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full 1996 results for Spanish holding company Corporacion Financiera Alba in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Net taxed				   7.51   vs  6.88</p>
<p>Net profit on equity-consolidated</p>
<p> holdings				   10.22   vs  9.83</p>
<p> Rental income			     1.42   vs  1.64</p>
<p> Total recurrent income		 11.80   vs  11.71</p>
<p> Financial charges			-1.43   vs  -1.03</p>
<p> Profits from portfolio		  8.22   vs   6.92</p>
<p> Atypicals, provisions		  -6.45   vs  -0.55</p>
<p> Total costs				-1.51   vs  -2.60</p>
<p>NOTE: Alba said it would pay a final dividend of 60 pesetas, for a total dividend of 120 pesetas per share</p>
</text>
